### ============ CU-03: Agendar Citas (paciente autenticado) ============

GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches

GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1/specialties

GET http://localhost:8080/api/branches/1/specialties/1/doctors
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.token}}

GET http://localhost:8080/api/doctors/2/available-slots?fecha=2026-08-20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.token}}

POST http://localhost:8080/api/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "pacienteId": 6,
  "sucursalId": 1,
  "especialidadId": 1,
  "medicoId": 2,
  "fechaHora": "2026-08-20T09:00:00",
  "motivoConsulta": "Dolor abdominal leve de dos días de evolución"
}


### ============ CU-04: Pago en Línea con Tarjeta (paciente autenticado) ============
