Authorization: Bearer {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "citaId": 1,
  "numeroTarjeta": "4532015112830366",
  "nombreTitular": "SOFIA RAMIREZ",
  "vencimiento": "12/28",
  "cvv": "123",
  "idempotencyKey": "demo-pago-001"
}

### Alternativa: tarjeta rechazada (FA03)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginPaciente.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "citaId": 1,
  "numeroTarjeta": "4000000000000002",
  "nombreTitular": "SOFIA RAMIREZ",
  "vencimiento": "12/28",
  "cvv": "123",
